# Cost-center attribution for Claude Code OpenTelemetry.
# Claude Code adds these resource attributes to every metric and event, so dashboards
# (Cloud Monitoring, Grafana, Splunk, ...) can filter and aggregate by them.
# Replace the example values with your own departments and cost centers.
#
# Telemetry itself must be enabled first - see https://code.claude.com/docs/en/monitoring-usage
# (or set a telemetry destination on the Claude apps gateway, which enables it for signed-in
# developers and adds verified email and IdP groups automatically).

OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES=department=engineering,cost_center=eng-123
